<title>HONG KONG: Leefung-Asco interim net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Leefung-Asco interim net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   8.9    vs 2.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.5    vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs 22.84 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    25.21  vs 8.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		     300.95 vs 259.50</p>
<p>    Company name		 Leefung-Asco Printers Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 7-10, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 22, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Leefung-Asco Printers is a printing company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
